sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant W as Admin panel
    participant S as Express API
    participant D as SQL Server
    A->>W: Add vehicle with supplier and parts
    W->>S: POST /api/insert-car
    S->>D: insert supplier, car, its parts and inventory
    S->>D: insert purchase transaction
    A->>W: Record a sale for a customer
    W->>S: POST /api/salesinseration
    S->>D: insert sale (paid / pending)
    S->>D: update inventory quantity
    S->>D: insert sale transaction
    W->>S: GET /api/getcalcluation
    S-->>W: total sales, paid and pending for the dashboard
